      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3 · Chat with your PDFs\n**Step A** · Put PDFs in `files/docs` and click **Execute workflow** on *Load PDFs*: they are split, embedded with `nomic-embed-text` and stored in memory.\n\n**Step B** · Click **Open chat** and ask questions. The agent searches your PDFs first and answers with a local model.\n\n⚠️ Simple Vector Store lives in RAM: run Step A again after a restart.",
